oomol/oo-amara  1.0.0 -> 1.0.1
change_type: instructions+docs   changelog: - Operates Amara through the OOMOL `oo` CLI connector using server-side credential injection. - Supports creating and updating videos, subtitle languages, subtitle versions, notes, and video URLs. - Provides read actions for videos, subtitle data, teams, users, activity, languages, notes, and URL metadata. - Includes subtitle workflow controls such as listing available actions and publishing, approving, or rejecting subtitles. - Documents safety expectations for read, write, and destructive Amar

